Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:26:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] gugu: forward Claude automatic compaction readings

Why: Claude Code is the authority for its effective threshold and enablement. Report those fields on the existing usage update for the session and model that ran, without waiting for the SDK control request before finishing the turn.

Upstream: no corresponding PR. Drop when ACP usage updates from upstream carry the effective automatic compaction reading with model provenance.
